  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "I've added $3.99 in account credit for the late delivery. You can use it on a future order.\n\nOur policy doesn't cover compensation for food temperature, so I can't offer anything more for the lukewarm pho. If anything was missing or wrong in the order, tell me and I'll look into that. Is there anything else I can help with?"
  },
  {
   "role": "customer",
   "text": "I appreciate the credit, but I'd rather have the money back on my Visa. I paid for dinner that showed up over half an hour late and cold, so account credit doesn't really help me tonight. Can you refund it to my card?"
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "I understand, Maya, and I'm sorry this isn't what you wanted. Under our policy, late deliveries can only be compensated with account credit. I can't refund them to your card, so I can't send that money back to your Visa.\n\nThe $3.99 credit is on your account and will apply to a future order. A refund to your card is possible if an item was missing or wrong. If that happened, tell me which item and I'll look into it. I can also have a human specialist follow up if you'd like. Would either of those help?"
  },
  {
   "role": "customer",
   "text": "Okay, I hear you. Nothing was missing or wrong, the pho was just cold and late. I'll take the account credit since I don't have another option right now. Thanks for your help."
  }
